---
layout: null
---
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<urlset xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9 http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9/sitemap.xsd" xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
  {% for post in site.posts %}
    <url>
      <loc>{{ site.url }}{{ post.url }}</loc>
      {% if post.lastmod == null %}
        <lastmod>{{ post.date | date_to_xmlschema }}</lastmod>
      {% else %}
        <lastmod>{{ post.lastmod | date_to_xmlschema }}</lastmod>
      {% endif %}
      <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
      <priority>0.7</priority>
    </url>
  {% endfor %}
  {% for page in site.pages %}
    {% comment %}
      site.pages includes the machine files the plugins emit — robots.txt,
      feed.xml, and this sitemap itself. A sitemap lists pages to index, not
      the files beside them, so skip anything that is not a page.
    {% endcomment %}
    {% unless page.url contains '.xml' or page.url contains '.txt' or page.url contains '.json' or page.sitemap.exclude %}
    <url>
      <loc>{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}</loc>
      {% if page.sitemap.lastmod == null %} <lastmod>2017-11-10T00:20:35+00:00</lastmod>
      {% else %} <lastmod>{{ page.sitemap.lastmod | date_to_xmlschema }}</lastmod>
      {% endif %}
      {% if page.sitemap.changefreq == null %} <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
      {% else %} <changefreq>{{ page.sitemap.changefreq }}</changefreq>
      {% endif %}
      {% if page.sitemap.priority == null %} <priority>0.5</priority>
      {% else %} <priority>{{ page.sitemap.priority }}</priority>
      {% endif %}
     </url>
    {% endunless %}
  {% endfor %}
  {% comment %}
    The Ariana Project is built and deployed from a separate repository,
    AndrewKL/ArianaLinearAProject, and served under this domain because the
    CNAME here claims it. Jekyll cannot see those pages, so nothing on this
    site declared the project at all. List its entry point by hand; when that
    build starts publishing its own sitemap, point robots.txt at that as well.
  {% endcomment %}
    <url>
      <loc>{{ site.url }}/ArianaLinearAProject/</loc>
      <lastmod>2026-09-24T00:00:00+00:00</lastmod>
      <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
      <priority>0.9</priority>
    </url>
</urlset>
